A struct's points-to as one of its fields and the rest (`<S>_split_<f>`), for a spec that takes
the field's points-to (`TxStats.add(&tx.stats)`). The rest is written with projections of the
value, so it does not change when the field does (`<S>_rest_<f>` of `{ v with f := w }` is
that of `v`, by `rfl`). Generated by `tmp/dbpred/gen_field_split.py`.
-/
module

public import Proof.go_etcd_io.bbolt.Init

@[expose] public section

noncomputable section

